3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:10,930
Up

4
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:12,650
is the rebirth of eight notes.

5
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:14,870
While stop

6
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:16,420
represents the last sound.

7
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:19,860
I think

8
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:22,610
life is the same.

9
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,410
Sometimes,

10
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,160
the point isn't choosing
right or wrong,

11
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:42,540
but having someone who

12
00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:44,940
can hear the resonance with you

13
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:47,510
when you're most scared.

14
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:54,550
This is for you.

15
00:00:57,090 --> 00:00:58,120
This is...

16
00:00:58,140 --> 00:00:58,960
I think

17
00:00:58,980 --> 00:01:00,280
it suits you.

18
00:01:01,730 --> 00:01:02,500
Thank you.

19
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:08,100
I'll keep it.

20
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:08,550
[Smile After Tears]

21
00:02:08,699 --> 00:02:13,650
[The 12th fret: Resonance of choices]

22
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:30,350
After losing He,

23
00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:33,780
I felt lost.

24
00:02:35,510 --> 00:02:37,240
I thought I found my direction.

25
00:02:38,150 --> 00:02:39,290
But

26
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:41,670
[Senior He]

27
00:02:40,030 --> 00:02:41,730
I was just going in circles.

28
00:02:45,510 --> 00:02:48,130
I really want to finish He's song.

29
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:57,860
When you turn around,
I'll wipe your tears.

30
00:02:57,880 --> 00:03:02,250
I'll smile and say goodbye from afar.

31
00:03:04,210 --> 00:03:05,520
My brother smiled a lot

32
00:03:05,550 --> 00:03:07,020
during that time.

33
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:12,180
[When you turn around,
I'll wipe your tears.]

34
00:03:10,610 --> 00:03:12,750
He must've shared a lot of

35
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:15,140
[When you turn around,
I'll wipe your tears.]

36
00:03:12,750 --> 00:03:14,080
his happiness with you.

37
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:21,170
But no matter how bright the sky gets,

38
00:03:21,170 --> 00:03:22,810
it will finally get dark.

39
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:25,800
The most important thing is

40
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,130
that you're still here,

41
00:03:27,940 --> 00:03:29,370
and you can start again.

42
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,030
Junjia.

43
00:04:30,850 --> 00:04:32,380
Where are you?

44
00:04:40,550 --> 00:04:41,450
Junjia.

45
00:04:50,420 --> 00:04:54,650
[High School Hot Music]

46
00:04:55,860 --> 00:04:56,659
It's over.

47
00:04:56,820 --> 00:04:59,080
What should we do? It'll be our turn soon.

48
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,950
I'll text him now.

49
00:05:01,030 --> 00:05:01,960
He's not the kind of person

50
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:03,420
who doesn't answer calls.

51
00:05:05,590 --> 00:05:06,390
Is it Junjia?

52
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,970
You should get ready.

53
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,770
Okay, right away.

54
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,140
What should I do?

55
00:05:13,570 --> 00:05:14,840
[The Star of Life Ambulance Co., Ltd.]

56
00:05:19,980 --> 00:05:20,740
[The Star of Life Ambulance Co., Ltd.]

57
00:05:25,470 --> 00:05:27,530
[No vehicles allowed]

58
00:05:42,670 --> 00:05:44,320
Sir, are you okay?

59
00:06:02,650 --> 00:06:03,660
Diaoqin.

60
00:06:16,380 --> 00:06:17,240
Great.

61
00:06:17,420 --> 00:06:18,390
You're fine.

62
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,890
I'm fine.

63
00:06:23,170 --> 00:06:25,480
A car rushed over.

64
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:26,560
I dodged.

65
00:06:26,820 --> 00:06:27,580
But

66
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:29,180
