67
00:06:29,210 --> 00:06:30,750
so I stayed to help.

68
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:36,820
But

69
00:06:39,090 --> 00:06:40,890
my phone was broken.

70
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,680
That's good.

71
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:46,380
Let's go.

72
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:48,800
Everyone is waiting for you.

73
00:06:55,700 --> 00:06:56,780
Did he pick up?

74
00:06:56,990 --> 00:06:57,780
Call that junior.

75
00:06:57,780 --> 00:06:58,310
Junior?

76
00:07:01,740 --> 00:07:02,710
I'm here.

77
00:07:02,710 --> 00:07:03,730
[High School Hot Music]

78
00:07:05,410 --> 00:07:07,130
Junjia, you're finally here.

79
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,390
Are you okay?

80
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:09,890
I'm fine.

81
00:07:09,910 --> 00:07:11,090
Good.

82
00:07:11,110 --> 00:07:11,790
Tie,

83
00:07:11,790 --> 00:07:13,090
let’s get ready outside.

84
00:07:13,090 --> 00:07:13,530
Okay.

85
00:07:14,530 --> 00:07:15,630
Junjia, don't be nervous.

86
00:07:15,630 --> 00:07:16,600
Leave your things here.

87
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,030
We'll wait for you outside.

88
00:07:18,030 --> 00:07:18,800
Hurry up.

89
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:19,850
We'll wait for you.

90
00:07:19,850 --> 00:07:21,820
I'll take your chain out for you.

91
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:23,980
I’ll talk to the organizer.

92
00:07:29,350 --> 00:07:29,960
Junjia.

93
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,659
I'll wait for you outside.

94
00:08:16,710 --> 00:08:17,580
Jiayi.

95
00:08:30,340 --> 00:08:31,410
He.

96
00:08:35,610 --> 00:08:37,039
I've used many chances

97
00:08:37,780 --> 00:08:39,309
to open the door many times.

98
00:08:40,059 --> 00:08:41,390
I finally get to see you.

99
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:44,760
You know what?

100
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:48,380
I've been looking for you for a long time.

101
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:50,730
But every time,

102
00:08:53,300 --> 00:08:55,300
you didn't turn around to look at me.

103
00:08:56,690 --> 00:08:58,030
I had six chances

104
00:08:58,620 --> 00:09:00,630
to say goodbye to you.

105
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,440
Junjia.

106
00:09:47,150 --> 00:09:48,080
It’s okay.

107
00:09:48,260 --> 00:09:50,230
We've been practicing a lot lately.

108
00:09:50,230 --> 00:09:51,630
It's just a small injury.

109
00:09:54,310 --> 00:09:54,900
Look.

110
00:09:55,910 --> 00:09:57,000
If it hurts,

111
00:09:57,020 --> 00:09:58,280
why didn't you tell me?

112
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,310
That's it for today.

113
00:10:07,330 --> 00:10:08,290
I’m leaving.

114
00:10:10,570 --> 00:10:11,140
Junjia.

115
00:10:22,470 --> 00:10:24,270
I'm always by your side.

116
00:10:26,230 --> 00:10:27,060
Jiayi.

117
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:33,880
I miss you so much.

118
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:38,470
I miss you too.

119
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,360
I'm sorry

120
00:10:52,340 --> 00:10:53,970
I can't be with you anymore.

121
00:10:55,970 --> 00:10:56,770
He.

122
00:10:57,910 --> 00:10:58,810
Promise me.

123
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:00,980
Even without me,

124
00:11:02,890 --> 00:11:05,550
