you deserve to be loved.

125
00:11:05,710 --> 00:11:07,550
Can't you stay a little longer?

126
00:11:12,300 --> 00:11:12,930
I...

127
00:11:19,830 --> 00:11:20,900
Do you remember

128
00:11:22,340 --> 00:11:24,360
we made a wish

129
00:11:24,500 --> 00:11:25,700
at the aquarium?

130
00:11:31,260 --> 00:11:32,050
At that time,

131
00:11:33,570 --> 00:11:35,230
I wanted both of us to be happy.

132
00:11:38,180 --> 00:11:39,100
Happiness

133
00:11:41,210 --> 00:11:43,210
doesn't mean we have to be together,

134
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,600
but to live well.

135
00:11:46,340 --> 00:11:49,210
We will be heartbroken since we can't
get our love,

136
00:11:56,660 --> 00:11:58,660
and sad because we lose each other.

137
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:08,620
But we still need to take
our love seriously.

138
00:12:11,350 --> 00:12:12,180
At least,

139
00:12:14,430 --> 00:12:15,960
we really loved each other.

140
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:17,790
That's enough.

141
00:12:21,950 --> 00:12:23,450
This is happiness.

142
00:12:34,820 --> 00:12:36,180
Just remember me.

143
00:12:40,310 --> 00:12:41,930
When you stand on the stage

144
00:12:43,690 --> 00:12:45,550
and sing the words "turn around",

145
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:48,710
imagine I'm by your side.

146
00:14:01,280 --> 00:14:06,210
When you turn around,
I'll wipe your tears.

147
00:14:04,980 --> 00:14:09,630
[BACKSPACE]

148
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:10,740
I'll smile and say goodbye from afar.

149
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:28,960
♪ Watching you drown in sadness ♪

150
00:14:29,780 --> 00:14:32,770
♪ In your tears ♪

151
00:14:33,690 --> 00:14:36,540
♪ I wonder what love is ♪

152
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:40,810
♪ It's when you're alone,
someone is by your side ♪

153
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:49,320
♪ It's when you're lost,
someone points out the right direction ♪

154
00:14:49,970 --> 00:14:54,980
♪ Though you have nothing,
you won't turn around ♪

155
00:14:55,870 --> 00:14:57,120
♪ But you are in midsummer ♪

156
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:58,520
♪ In spring flowers ♪

157
00:14:59,020 --> 00:15:02,600
♪ In the aurora full of sky ♪

158
00:15:06,180 --> 00:15:08,350
♪ I can only wait for you ♪

159
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:11,900
♪ I can't be afraid of you getting hurt ♪

160
00:15:12,370 --> 00:15:16,430
♪ It reminds us that
freedom is also a cage ♪

161
00:15:17,140 --> 00:15:19,630
♪ Between us ♪

162
00:15:20,510 --> 00:15:23,560
♪ Repeating ♪

163
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:27,780
♪ After you turn around,
I'll wipe your tears ♪

164
00:15:29,340 --> 00:15:30,270
Jiayi,

165
00:15:29,680 --> 00:15:33,040
♪ Hugging and hovering, only in dreams ♪

166
00:15:32,930 --> 00:15:34,220
you finally sing

167
00:15:33,670 --> 00:15:38,110
♪ After you turn around,
I'll wipe your tears ♪

168
00:15:35,380 --> 00:15:36,850
your voice.

169
00:15:39,030 --> 00:15:43,520
♪ Hugging and spinning,
in the room that doesn't exist♪

170
00:15:43,820 --> 00:15:44,890
Time's up.

171
00:15:44,670 --> 00:15:47,520
♪ Hope, hope again ♪

172
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:50,490
♪ You have no tears ♪

173
00:15:51,050 --> 00:15:54,880
♪ I'll smile from afar, goodbye ♪

174
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:05,990
[BACKSPACE]

175
00:16:15,770 --> 00:16:16,870
Thank you

176
00:16:19,100 --> 00:16:21,030
for letting me know how love feels.

177
00:16:38,350 --> 00:16:41,800
[BACKSPACE]

178
00:16:44,700 --> 00:16:47,020
[Live]

179
00:16:45,830 --> 00:16:47,950
Today's guests are very special.

180
00:16:47,730 --> 00:16:49,390
[Studio 1]

181
00:16:48,140 --> 00:16:49,820
They are

182
00:16:49,850 --> 00:16:52,460
BACKSPACE, the high school band
that gained much popularity

183
00:16:52,460 --> 00:16:54,480
in the competition with an original song.

184
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:56,450
Welcome to our show today.

185
00:16:56,610 --> 00:16:58,630
Say hello to everyone, okay?

186
00:16:59,910 --> 00:17:02,470
Hello, we're BACKSPACE.

187
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:04,450
First of all,

188
00:17:04,450 --> 00:17:06,690
on behalf of our audience,
I'd like to ask you a question.

189
00:17:06,690 --> 00:17:08,359
What's your creative idea

190
00:17:08,359 --> 00:17:10,849
about this song?

191
00:17:12,660 --> 00:17:13,859
This song is

192
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:17,030
for those who lost something.

193
00:17:19,430 --> 00:17:19,829
Okay.

194
00:17:19,829 --> 00:17:22,380
Let's listen to this song first.

195
00:17:26,690 --> 00:17:31,170
♪ Watching you drown in sadness ♪

196
00:17:31,980 --> 00:17:34,980
♪ In your tears ♪

197
00:17:35,890 --> 00:17:38,750
♪ I wonder what love is ♪

198
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:42,920
♪ It's when you're alone,
someone is by your side ♪

199
00:17:47,520 --> 00:17:51,410
♪ It's when you're lost,
someone points out the right direction ♪

200
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:50,630
Regret

201
00:17:50,630 --> 00:17:51,800
is like a shadow.

202
00:17:52,180 --> 00:17:57,180
♪ Though you have nothing,
you won't turn around ♪

203
00:17:52,850 --> 00:17:54,650
Wherever you go, it will be here.

204
00:17:58,070 --> 00:17:59,220
♪ But you are in midsummer ♪

205
00:17:59,650 --> 00:18:00,750
♪ In spring flowers ♪

206
00:18:01,230 --> 00:18:04,810
♪ In the aurora full of sky ♪

207
00:18:05,690 --> 00:18:06,800
But

208
00:18:06,930 --> 00:18:08,150
it reminds us

209
00:18:08,390 --> 00:18:10,560
♪ I can only wait for you ♪

210
00:18:09,070 --> 00:18:11,410
the sun used to shine on us.

211
00:18:11,290 --> 00:18:14,110
♪ I can't be afraid of you getting hurt ♪

212
00:18:14,580 --> 00:18:18,640
♪ It reminds us that
freedom is also a cage ♪

213
00:18:19,350 --> 00:18:21,840
♪ Between us ♪

214
00:18:22,710 --> 00:18:25,770
♪ Repeating ♪

215
00:18:26,490 --> 00:18:29,990
♪ After you turn around,
I'll wipe your tears ♪

216
00:18:31,890 --> 00:18:35,250
♪ Hugging and hovering, only in dreams ♪

217
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:40,320
♪ After you turn around,
I'll wipe your tears ♪

218
00:18:39,080 --> 00:18:41,920
Regret is not because we lost something,

219
00:18:41,230 --> 00:18:45,720
♪ Hugging and spinning,
in the room that doesn't exist♪

220
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:49,560
♪ Hope, hope again ♪

221
00:18:48,870 --> 00:18:50,030
but because

222
00:18:50,060 --> 00:18:51,950
we once possessed it.

223
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:52,410
♪ You have no tears ♪

224
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:54,470
This is a part of life.

225
00:18:53,250 --> 00:18:56,780
♪ I'll smile from afar, goodbye ♪

226
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:55,550
[Live]

227
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:07,270
Without regret,

228
00:19:07,970 --> 00:19:09,970
life will be boring.

229
00:19:10,730 --> 00:19:12,510
Thanks to regret,

230
00:19:13,150 --> 00:19:14,750
we cherish

231
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:15,880
every minute

232
00:19:15,940 --> 00:19:16,970
and every second.

233
00:19:18,820 --> 00:19:20,630
I hope what we lost in the end

234
00:19:22,370 --> 00:19:25,190
can become the most beautiful memory.

235
00:19:30,760 --> 00:19:33,150
[Junjia]

236
00:19:35,300 --> 00:19:35,870
Hello.

237
00:19:37,580 --> 00:19:38,420
Junjia.

238
00:19:39,070 --> 00:19:41,150
[Dalang, Korean Skewers,
Fried Chicken, Drinks]

239
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:41,830
One for each.

240
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:42,780
Thank you.

241
00:19:48,320 --> 00:19:50,610
You did a great job.

242
00:19:51,220 --> 00:19:52,350
Take these

243
00:19:53,350 --> 00:19:55,820
as a token of our gratitude.

244
00:19:55,820 --> 00:19:57,320
Please enjoy your meal.

245
00:19:57,520 --> 00:19:59,060
-Thank you, sir.
-Thank you.

246
00:19:59,060 --> 00:20:01,130
It doesn't matter that
you didn't win a prize.

247
00:20:01,130 --> 00:20:03,200
You're popular and even on the radio.

248
00:20:03,590 --> 00:20:05,140
I love to be a popular guy.

249
00:20:06,170 --> 00:20:07,270
As the president,

250
00:20:07,940 --> 00:20:09,570
I have to say one thing.

251
00:20:10,300 --> 00:20:12,700
Although we don't have
a ranking this time,

252
00:20:13,250 --> 00:20:14,910
we're the most popular band.

253
00:20:14,980 --> 00:20:16,910
It's more worth it than the trophy.

254
00:20:18,150 --> 00:20:18,850
Yes.

255
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:20,500
What's important is we did it together.

256
00:20:20,500 --> 00:20:21,330
Yes.

257
00:20:21,350 --> 00:20:23,830
This song will stay in our hearts forever.

258
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:26,600
It doesn't matter whether
we get anything or not.

259
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:29,280
The most important and happiest thing is

260
00:20:29,500 --> 00:20:31,300
we can finish the song together.

261
00:20:36,860 --> 00:20:37,760
Let's...

262
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:38,670
Wait.

263
00:20:38,700 --> 00:20:40,560
We two also want to toast with you.

264
00:20:40,860 --> 00:20:42,520
Yes, we want to toast with you.

265
00:20:42,440 --> 00:20:46,190
[Dalang, Korean Skewers,
Fried Chicken, Drinks]

266
00:20:42,870 --> 00:20:44,740
-Come on.
-Come on.

267
00:20:44,740 --> 00:20:47,760
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

268
00:20:48,110 --> 00:20:50,220
Losing is scary.

269
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:53,180
Regret will break your heart.

270
00:20:54,580 --> 00:20:55,650
But

271
00:20:55,650 --> 00:20:57,650
once you go through it with someone,

272
00:20:57,850 --> 00:20:59,020
you'll understand

273
00:21:03,020 --> 00:21:04,160
tears

274
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:05,690
are never the end,

275
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:11,130
but to let us remember

276
00:21:11,530 --> 00:21:13,000
the traces of love.

277
00:21:15,940 --> 00:21:16,870
If you

278
00:21:17,580 --> 00:21:19,040
go to America,

279
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:21,240
remember to bring me a souvenir.

280
00:21:21,980 --> 00:21:23,110
I'll think about it.

281
00:21:24,610 --> 00:21:25,310
No.

282
00:21:25,450 --> 00:21:27,050
You must bring me a souvenir.

283
00:21:28,020 --> 00:21:28,550
Okay.

284
00:21:33,820 --> 00:21:35,840
[My Guitar Friend]

285
00:21:36,960 --> 00:21:38,980
[Closed]

286
00:21:44,290 --> 00:21:48,300
[My Guitar Friend]

287
00:21:44,430 --> 00:21:46,190
Even though it's closed,

288
00:21:46,470 --> 00:21:47,720
music is still there.

289
00:21:48,170 --> 00:21:49,980
And these instruments

290
00:21:50,740 --> 00:21:52,310
are still shining.

291
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:55,810
Life is the same.

292
00:21:56,410 --> 00:21:58,490
No matter what happens in the end,

293
00:21:58,980 --> 00:22:01,060
we have to keep

294
00:22:01,550 --> 00:22:02,850
shining.

295
00:22:15,930 --> 00:22:17,910
It's time

296
00:22:18,250 --> 00:22:20,020
for me to leave.

297
00:22:22,710 --> 00:22:23,530
Okay.

298
00:23:06,650 --> 00:23:08,230
Can you wait for me?

299
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:16,520
I'll be back soon.

300
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:17,490
Bye.

301
00:23:20,360 --> 00:23:21,190
Goodbye.

302
00:23:24,750 --> 00:23:26,100
Even though I have to leave,

303
00:23:26,100 --> 00:23:27,430
I don't feel lonely,

304
00:23:31,300 --> 00:23:33,180
because when I turn around,

305
00:23:33,690 --> 00:23:35,260
someone will always

306
00:23:38,610 --> 00:23:40,110
be waiting for me to say,

307
00:23:40,140 --> 00:23:41,140
"Goodbye."

308
00:23:46,760 --> 00:23:48,210
The saying "Goodbye"

309
00:23:48,950 --> 00:23:51,210
is another way to say

310
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:56,430
"We'll meet again".
